      "distance": "minimum unweighted squared RGB distance across indices 1..255, retaining all ties; not claimed to be LibreDWG behavior or ODA behavior",
      "note": "LibreDWG dwg_find_color_index does an exact table match and returns 256 for unmatched RGB; it is not a closest-color algorithm."
